<title>UK: Ventspils closed Thurs due to high winds - shipper.</title>
<headline>Ventspils closed Thurs due to high winds - shipper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Latvian oil port of Ventspils was closed on Wednesday night due to high winds, a shipping source said on Thursday.</p>
<p>No vessels were loading or berthing on Thursday morning the source said.</p>
<p>The crude pipeline supplying the port was still running at full capacity of around 325,000 barrels per day on Thursday morning, but throughput is expected to be reduced as storage is filled.</p>
<p>The Black Sea ports of Novorossiisk, Odessa and Tuapse were all operating normally on Thursday, the shipping source said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
